# Style profile: comic book panels. Select with STYLE_PROFILE=comic or `shorts --style comic`.
# Verified 2026-11-17: Z-Image renders it crisply and LTX-2.3 animates it without smearing the line art.
STYLE_PROMPT=single full-bleed comic book panel filling the whole frame, inked line art, halftone dot shading, bold shadows, dynamic angle, vintage comic print colors, vertical composition
NEGATIVE_PROMPT=multiple panels, comic page layout, panel grid, panel borders, split screen, text, letters, speech bubble, caption box, sound effect lettering, watermark, logo, signature, photo, photorealistic, 3d render, blurry, lowres, deformed
STYLE_GUIDE=Think in comic panels: dynamic angles, dramatic perspective and exaggerated scale are welcome, one strong focal subject with a detailed drawn background, clear silhouettes. Each image is ONE panel: never ask for multiple panels, split screens or page layouts. Never ask for speech bubbles, captions or lettering.
MOTION_I2V_PROMPT_SUFFIX=comic book animation, line art stays crisp
CAPTION_FONT=Bangers
CAPTION_FONT_SIZE=112              # Bangers is narrow: a bit bigger than the default 92
CAPTION_COLOR=#FFFFFF
CAPTION_HIGHLIGHT_COLOR=#FFE500
CAPTION_OUTLINE_COLOR=#000000
CAPTION_OUTLINE=8
